    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torchure</strong> is a brutal roguelite action game set in a twisted 19th-century England, where industrial greed, slavery, and corruption have rotted the empire to its core. Play as a vengeful former slave, spark chaos in a decaying world, and watch as your actions ignite fires, rebellions, and the empire\u2019s collapse. Master tactical combat, manipulate enemy factions, and unleash chain reactions of destruction in a world where every object\u2014and every choice\u2014can lead to explosive consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Controlled Chaos</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger domino-like disasters: shoot a barrel, burn a factory, and watch flames spread realistically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies against each other: lure rival factions into deadly clashes and profit from the carnage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Dynamic World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire spreads, enemies panic</strong>: Burn buildings, scare foes into traps, or let them flee to spread chaos elsewhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle army builder</strong>: Rescue prisoners to fight for you\u2014or work silently to fund your rebellion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Souls-like Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight smart or die fast: parry, dodge, and manage stamina in intense melee battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with weapons, armor, and perks that change how you survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Roguelite Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades: Boost stats, unlock abilities, and grow stronger between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized arenas: No two playthroughs are the same. Adapt or perish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad A World Rotting Alive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grim, pixel-art world of smoke-choked cities, rebel hideouts, and crumbling mansions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story through environmental clues, cryptic notes, and the bloodshed you leave behind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the spark that destroys an empire?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torchure</strong> is a brutal roguelite action game set in a twisted 19th-century England, where industrial greed, slavery, and corruption have rotted the empire to its core. Play as a vengeful former slave, spark chaos in a decaying world, and watch as your actions ignite fires, rebellions, and the empire\u2019s collapse. Master tactical combat, manipulate enemy factions, and unleash chain reactions of destruction in a world where every object\u2014and every choice\u2014can lead to explosive consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/252596355fcf0b79f9ff958b8a893604.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Controlled Chaos</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger domino-like disasters: shoot a barrel, burn a factory, and watch flames spread realistically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies against each other: lure rival factions into deadly clashes and profit from the carnage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/25fac8af6c328c78a77d14438870ed8a.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Dynamic World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire spreads, enemies panic</strong>: Burn buildings, scare foes into traps, or let them flee to spread chaos elsewhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle army builder</strong>: Rescue prisoners to fight for you\u2014or work silently to fund your rebellion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.poster.avif?t=1752935301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.webm?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605240/extras/ee9ea4b26577482a86bdbfbd8147d1d2.mp4?t=1752935301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Souls-like Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight smart or die fast: parry, dodge, and manage stamina in intense melee battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with weapons, armor, and perks that change how you survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Roguelite Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades: Boost stats, unlock abilities, and grow stronger between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized arenas: No two playthroughs are the same. Adapt or perish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad A World Rotting Alive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grim, pixel-art world of smoke-choked cities, rebel hideouts, and crumbling mansions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story through environmental clues, cryptic notes, and the bloodshed you leave behind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the spark that destroys an empire?</strong></p>",
